      <h1 id="multinetworkpolicy-k8s-cni-cncf-io-v1beta1" class="group scroll-mt-20">MultiNetworkPolicy [k8s.cni.cncf.io/v1beta1]<a href="#multinetworkpolicy-k8s-cni-cncf-io-v1beta1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>MultiNetworkPolicy is a CRD schema to provide NetworkPolicy mechanism for net-attach-def which is specified by the Network Plumbing Working Group. MultiNetworkPolicy is identical to Kubernetes NetworkPolicy, See: https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/services-networking/network-policies/ .</p></dd>
